    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c78b77b02857263b2d91eea1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "方才与她搭话的，乃是目白家的千金——\r\n目白阿尔丹。虽然她的学年比千代王更高，\r\n但二人却在同年出道。",
      "source_fingerprint": "05670ce39c4137b461b7c247b14521a2eadc3f1db2f84d8ac7f7ac208c3a3607",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
