    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca6877697da4e45297c0f6df",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "现在再看看，这数量真是可怕。\r\n似乎在我注意力放在千代王身上的时候，\r\n学园里也转入了不少实力强劲的孩子……",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b45ee1ffa9c56802a8216c7cea33d2b6f90deb974a13aa12a9fec3c3f8eebcc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
