      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "现在的千代王因为过度紧张而大脑一片空白。\r\n没办法……\r\n为了她，我来帮她记住这些劲敌的特征吧——",
      "source_fingerprint": "3425cc907f4855ff595792befdb59c9ec1c2868b2f0733f586623072b8aac8dc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
