      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "突然，樱花千代王悄悄碰了碰我，\r\n把『什么东西』塞进了我的怀里。",
      "source_fingerprint": "88495fc5351def599f0bebec7998c3f391543b974f3468a8179d788e074ddadc",
